Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:05.420
When it comes to esports, we've learned to expect that sometimes things can get a bit awkward.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.740
"For the thousands of attendants and millions watching around

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:15.780
the world are you ready?"

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.860
"Well thanks a lot Krimz, I appreciate you coming out here, it is a pleasure..."

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:55.400
