00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.440
With Twitch
there are emotes for basically

00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:02.570
everything and since we're talking about
a medium where anyone with a PC internet

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:08.000
connection and webcam can participate
things, sometimes get a little out of hand

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.320
"IBoy, how is it that you're able to play with so much confidence on the World stage?"

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:37.240
When that happens, when something is so
uncomfortable that it's funny, we call it

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:42.130
cringe humor and the solitary icon has
emerged to become quite literally the

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:45.080
face of that humorous discomfort.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.520
The haHAA emote was added to Better Twitch

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:52.540
TV, a browser extension that enables
additional emos on Twitch in 2015.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:57.900
That means that while anyone can type haHAA
you only see the emote if you have BTTV

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:03.220
installed. With haHAA you're not laughing
with someone you're laughing at someone.

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:06.520
"For about three months I thought it was
an actual laughing emote and I'm like

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:12.730
'Wow they're putting it again I'm gonna
keep telling these jokes.' That felt Pretty bad it's

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:15.670
like you know whenever you're like barely started middle school and like you

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:18.790
think all the cool kids are your friends
but they're actually secretly making fun

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:22.880
of you? I was the fat kid that day okay."

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:25.120
But who is this uncomfortable looking

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:30.300
guy in the image? It's actually actor and
comedian Andy Samberg playing a

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:35.230
character called Shy Ronnie. The haHAA
image originates from the second of two

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:38.840
skits he did as the character, both of
which featured Rihanna.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:44.260
The gag is that Ronnie is so shy around Rihanna that he's just hella awkward, unable to

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.780
complete a rap verse or really do
anything besides mumble.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:53.720
[Ronnie mumbles]

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:54.800
"Speak up."

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.120
Or laugh awkwardly.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:59.360
"Ha HAA!" "Ha HAA!" "Ha HAA!"

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.600
"Oh boy."

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.920
Also, for some reason a lot of

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:07.120
people oddly think that the picture is
of League of Legends Pro Bjergsen.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:12.460
[Laughter.]

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:17.840
A bizarre theory that can perhaps be
traced back to this copypasta.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:23.020
So the basic theory behind cringe humor is that
the discomfort caused by the subject and

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:26.640
often their lack of awareness of it is
funny.

