00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:18.680
Anyway haHAA is not without controversy. Some

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:22.160
Twitch channels began to ban the emote
arguing that it was used to describe

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:26.200
everything a streamer did, even when it
wasn't cringy.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.280
"You guys stop cringing

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:33.140
at everything. Please. I mean a lot of
people are just gonna have to stop

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:37.500
watching the stream because they gotta spam cringe face somewhere. Disable

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:44.879
cringe face? Yes. No. Everybody vote. Oh the
votes are coming in and it looks like

00:05:44.879 --> 00:05:48.960
disabled cringe face is winning? Oh
everyone's trying to spam haHAA and

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:56.060
getting timed out. Oh my god so many
people are getting time out. Jesus Christ."

00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:00.900
In other words they felt the emote was
just being spammed to insult and

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:05.219
disrespect the streamer. One high profile
case of this was on the stream for

00:06:05.219 --> 00:06:10.050
Awesome Games Done Quick in 2016. After
the channel banned the use of the word

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:15.150
cringe viewers instead used haHAA to
criticize the speedrunners taking part

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:18.569
in the event. The emote was eventually
banned from the Games Done Quick

00:06:18.569 --> 00:06:23.520
channel in 2017 with the justification
being that the emote was really only being

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:27.930
used negatively. Of course this just
meant the viewers came up with their own

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:32.370
variations. Some community members have
even petitioned to have the emote

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:36.960
removed from Better Twitch TV. What's
definitely true is that if everything is

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:44.030
cringe then nothing is. Cringe can be
funny, cringe can be painful,

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:49.610
or cringe can be both at the same time.
But it's defined by its deviation from

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:51.620
what we consider normal.

